            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="UNLABELLED">The aim of the article is to assist practitioners in the diagnosis and management of complete denture problems by addressing the problems from a theoretical viewpoint and in a clinically diagnostic way.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="CLINICAL RELEVANCE" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">To assist practitioners and undergraduates to understand the clinical basis of complete denture prosthodontics.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
